(2533886, 350466, 47541, '<td valign="top">this image may have been better if you had cropped the bottom at the base of the bridge as the picture is very busy beneath it</td>', 'this image may have been better if you had cropped the bottom at the base of the bridge as the picture is very busy beneath it', '2006-06-21 01:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
