(2533907, 349690, 49865, '<td valign="top">beautiful star trail photo. i love the color on the horizon, the interesting treeline silhouette and the red illuminated of the foreground</td>', 'beautiful star trail photo. i love the color on the horizon, the interesting treeline silhouette and the red illuminated of the foreground', '2006-06-21 01:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533920, 349759, 9833, '<td valign="top">Wow !! Very nice shot. Love the colors and setting !</td>', 'Wow !! Very nice shot. Love the colors and setting !', '2006-06-21 01:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533948, 350213, 45706, '<td valign="top">whoa,  scary but good</td>', 'whoa,  scary but good', '2006-06-21 01:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533963, 351030, 29490, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2006-06-21 01:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533995, 348950, 53147, '<td valign="top">Now this is an interesting idea. No waterfall around? Then make your own. Very cool.</td>', 'Now this is an interesting idea. No waterfall around? Then make your own. Very cool.', '2006-06-21 01:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534000, 350044, 28471, '<td valign="top">Nice job Bear - I think...excellent shot, the color balance is awesome.  Nice dreamy feel to this photo. (9)</td>', 'Nice job Bear - I think...excellent shot, the color balance is awesome.  Nice dreamy feel to this photo. (9)', '2006-06-21 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534029, 349821, 46336, '<td valign="top">Always nice to see a shot from home. Nothing wrong with it, but the composition doesnt grab me. Part of htis is the panarama crop and the indistinct border. I think a light thin (1 pixel in width) line between your existing border and the image would have given it more pop. Regarding the composition itself - it''s hard to do mountains justice in a full frame shot without a huge high-class lens from a great distance. Perhaps it would have worked better if you had cropped closer to Lions Head and Devils Peak for a squarer frame.<br/>I''ll give you 6 - Good luck</td>', 'Always nice to see a shot from home. Nothing wrong with it, but the composition doesnt grab me. Part of htis is the panarama crop and the indistinct border. I think a light thin (1 pixel in width) line between your existing border and the image would have given it more pop. Regarding the composition itself - it''s hard to do mountains justice in a full frame shot without a huge high-class lens from a great distance. Perhaps it would have worked better if you had cropped closer to Lions Head and Devils Peak for a squarer frame.I''ll give you 6 - Good luck', '2006-06-21 01:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534072, 350871, 46336, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had fun working on this. I''m sure you learnt loads. I should do it myself sometime. I''ll be interested to see your apperature at the end of the voting. <br/>Shame the central image is not as in focus as the other two. I do however like the balance and the border.</td>', 'Looks like you had fun working on this. I''m sure you learnt loads. I should do it myself sometime. I''ll be interested to see your apperature at the end of the voting. Shame the central image is not as in focus as the other two. I do however like the balance and the border.', '2006-06-21 01:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534076, 349873, 5885, '<td valign="top">This will score well. Nice capture.</td>', 'This will score well. Nice capture.', '2006-06-21 01:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534081, 347813, 46336, '<td valign="top">Ha - I can see this happening.</td>', 'Ha - I can see this happening.', '2006-06-21 01:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534091, 349084, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. I love the depth here... how many people did you use for this one? that''s a lot of running for 30 seconds...</td>', 'This is really cool. I love the depth here... how many people did you use for this one? that''s a lot of running for 30 seconds...', '2006-06-21 01:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534099, 350294, 36371, '<td valign="top">Way too dark. Can''t tell what it is at all. Sorry.</td>', 'Way too dark. Can''t tell what it is at all. Sorry.', '2006-06-21 01:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534111, 350028, 28710, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but this would have been SO much better with the bottom one gone... Nice execution though... I was thinking of doing something similar. A crop probably would have brought this up a good two notches for me...</td>', 'I hate to say it, but this would have been SO much better with the bottom one gone... Nice execution though... I was thinking of doing something similar. A crop probably would have brought this up a good two notches for me...', '2006-06-21 01:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534137, 348934, 772, '<td valign="top">Very poor choice of title.</td>', 'Very poor choice of title.', '2006-06-21 01:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534143, 350194, 28710, '<td valign="top">Another idea that passed through my head...<br/> <br/>Having a little trouble with liking the execution though... the blur on the one hand is good, but the extra flashes are a bit less well done I think... The lighting isn''t balanced either, which washes out the black numbers...<br/> <br/>The reason that I didn''t go with something like this is that it would have been very difficult for me to give it a special context...</td>', 'Another idea that passed through my head... Having a little trouble with liking the execution though... the blur on the one hand is good, but the extra flashes are a bit less well done I think... The lighting isn''t balanced either, which washes out the black numbers... The reason that I didn''t go with something like this is that it would have been very difficult for me to give it a special context...', '2006-06-21 01:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534150, 350044, 42013, '<td valign="top">What? no skiff?  Nice as usual.</td>', 'What? no skiff?  Nice as usual.', '2006-06-21 01:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
