(2534161, 350546, 28710, '<td valign="top">? Is that a thumb print on the top left corner?<br/> <br/>I like the colors here... needs a bit of something to bring out the detail in the pier itself... Is it a Pier or just a bridge? Hard to tell..</td>', '? Is that a thumb print on the top left corner? I like the colors here... needs a bit of something to bring out the detail in the pier itself... Is it a Pier or just a bridge? Hard to tell..', '2006-06-21 01:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534173, 350629, 28710, '<td valign="top">I like this... might be worth a quick look over the tutorial for correcting horizons in the tutorials section of this website.</td>', 'I like this... might be worth a quick look over the tutorial for correcting horizons in the tutorials section of this website.', '2006-06-21 01:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534185, 349978, 11518, '<td valign="top">Way overexposed...sorry...</td>', 'Way overexposed...sorry...', '2006-06-21 01:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534197, 347944, 28710, '<td valign="top">Well executed... a bit blown on the grass.. I presume that you used some heavy filtering? Or the lenscap? If not, nice work on the color balance.</td>', 'Well executed... a bit blown on the grass.. I presume that you used some heavy filtering? Or the lenscap? If not, nice work on the color balance.', '2006-06-21 01:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534209, 350938, 28710, '<td valign="top">Something I learned from this challenge was to use Neat Image first to prevent excessive noise in the sharpened results...<br/> <br/>I really like the colors here and the composition is nice too... It looks like you lit it with headlights form a car... am I right?</td>', 'Something I learned from this challenge was to use Neat Image first to prevent excessive noise in the sharpened results... I really like the colors here and the composition is nice too... It looks like you lit it with headlights form a car... am I right?', '2006-06-21 01:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534222, 350973, 28710, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''m a fan of two-tones and monochromatic pics... Looks like you may have pushed things a bit to accentuate the blue because the lights of the city appear shifted, but I still like it... I''m sure that outside of basic editing rules, you''d take care of that... Great lines.</td>', 'Very nice. I''m a fan of two-tones and monochromatic pics... Looks like you may have pushed things a bit to accentuate the blue because the lights of the city appear shifted, but I still like it... I''m sure that outside of basic editing rules, you''d take care of that... Great lines.', '2006-06-21 01:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534239, 349961, 46336, '<td valign="top">I love the lights, and the tones you''ve managed on the buildings. Personally I''m not a fan of the distortion (althoughs will of course love it). Still, the good things are great.</td>', 'I love the lights, and the tones you''ve managed on the buildings. Personally I''m not a fan of the distortion (althoughs will of course love it). Still, the good things are great.', '2006-06-21 01:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534243, 348412, 28710, '<td valign="top">What a great visual... It looks to me like your blacks aren''t entirely black though... a bit of a contrast jump?<br/> <br/>The color in the fire is superbly captured. that''s not really easy.<br/> <br/>The expression ''just walk towards the light'' keeps springing to mind... ;)</td>', 'What a great visual... It looks to me like your blacks aren''t entirely black though... a bit of a contrast jump? The color in the fire is superbly captured. that''s not really easy. The expression ''just walk towards the light'' keeps springing to mind... ;)', '2006-06-21 01:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
