(2534260, 350606, 46336, '<td valign="top">Now that is pretty cool. In terms of pure asthetics the flag is a distraction from all that is crisp, which is unfortunate as I do like the idea.</td>', 'Now that is pretty cool. In terms of pure asthetics the flag is a distraction from all that is crisp, which is unfortunate as I do like the idea.', '2006-06-21 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
