(2534270, 350912, 46336, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. I''m nto a fan of the border, but I do love the picture.</td>', 'Lovely composition. I''m nto a fan of the border, but I do love the picture.', '2006-06-21 01:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534280, 349007, 28710, '<td valign="top">I am going to guess that there is more work that was done on this than it looks like... The edging on the sparks looks a little different than what I expected. Further, the placement of the center of the event, plus the alignment, while it may have been unplanned, looks really cool to give a slight chaotic effect.<br/> <br/>Neat pic...<br/> <br/>I would have desaturated the blue and green channel to get rid of the odd stuff in the far left of the pic.</td>', 'I am going to guess that there is more work that was done on this than it looks like... The edging on the sparks looks a little different than what I expected. Further, the placement of the center of the event, plus the alignment, while it may have been unplanned, looks really cool to give a slight chaotic effect. Neat pic... I would have desaturated the blue and green channel to get rid of the odd stuff in the far left of the pic.', '2006-06-21 01:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534294, 350912, 28710, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!<br/> <br/>I love that border too... I wanted to do something like that myself... Very nicely done...<br/> <br/>It seems a TINY bit soft, but that''s quite acceptable for the theme and flavor of the pic.</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL! I love that border too... I wanted to do something like that myself... Very nicely done... It seems a TINY bit soft, but that''s quite acceptable for the theme and flavor of the pic.', '2006-06-21 01:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
