(2534298, 349744, 46336, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this. It is a remarkable picture, and the blow-outs on the yachts go some way towards making what it is. Unfortunately the blow-out are also harsh on the eye. I guess for this to really work I would want to see it a little less exposed (not easy in a 30 sec challenge).</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this. It is a remarkable picture, and the blow-outs on the yachts go some way towards making what it is. Unfortunately the blow-out are also harsh on the eye. I guess for this to really work I would want to see it a little less exposed (not easy in a 30 sec challenge).', '2006-06-21 01:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534303, 349232, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nicely themed tones...</td>', 'Nicely themed tones...', '2006-06-21 01:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
