(2535774, 349938, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but I have just seen to many lighting shots for this to impress me .  The same rule goes for lighting shots as star trail shots and norhern lights.  You need an interesting foreground or setting for it to stand out, the phenomenon isn´t strong enough to carry a photograph by itself.  This is still nice though, don´t get me wrong, nothing wrong about it at all.</td>', 'Not bad but I have just seen to many lighting shots for this to impress me .  The same rule goes for lighting shots as star trail shots and norhern lights.  You need an interesting foreground or setting for it to stand out, the phenomenon isn´t strong enough to carry a photograph by itself.  This is still nice though, don´t get me wrong, nothing wrong about it at all.', '2006-06-21 10:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535777, 349134, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the coloring in this one.</td>', 'Nice, love the coloring in this one.', '2006-06-21 10:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
