(2535813, 349581, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but sorry, IMHO you didn´t execute this as well as you could have as the faces are all to blurry for my taste, don´t know how you executed this shot but I find it best to use a flash or monolight to freeze the persons, just make it go off at the right time in the right pose and you would have gotten 3 crystal clear and focused faces in the shot.  Nice idea though as I said.</td>', 'Nice idea but sorry, IMHO you didn´t execute this as well as you could have as the faces are all to blurry for my taste, don´t know how you executed this shot but I find it best to use a flash or monolight to freeze the persons, just make it go off at the right time in the right pose and you would have gotten 3 crystal clear and focused faces in the shot.  Nice idea though as I said.', '2006-06-21 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
