(2535885, 349229, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I don´t really get the thinking behind this image as it just doesn´t make sense to me compositionally.  There is simply nothing in this image that I find interesting, there is simply nothing that draws my eye in and makes me want to linger over this.  I realize you probably chose this place to photograph as there seem to be lights on the bridge wich I assume you didn´t want in the frame as they would be blown out but I would have strolled down the beach a small distance to the left and taken a shot of the pier from that vantage point, composing it similar to this shot -&gt; <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=244395" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/392/thumb/244395.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/392/thumb/244395.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/392/thumb/244395.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>No offense intended but that is my honest opinion, ended giving it a 4.</td>', 'I am sorry but I don´t really get the thinking behind this image as it just doesn´t make sense to me compositionally.  There is simply nothing in this image that I find interesting, there is simply nothing that draws my eye in and makes me want to linger over this.  I realize you probably chose this place to photograph as there seem to be lights on the bridge wich I assume you didn´t want in the frame as they would be blown out but I would have strolled down the beach a small distance to the left and taken a shot of the pier from that vantage point, composing it similar to this shot ->   No offense intended but that is my honest opinion, ended giving it a 4.', '2006-06-21 10:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
