(2536279, 351035, 28710, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''s how you capture movement in a watch/clock... <br/> <br/>I was hoping to do something like this myself, but I don''t have a cool enough watch...</td>', 'Now THAT''s how you capture movement in a watch/clock...  I was hoping to do something like this myself, but I don''t have a cool enough watch...', '2006-06-21 12:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
