(2536314, 349689, 46314, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot. Has had me looking at it for ages.<br/>The way the colours of the water and the sky blend into one another make it look like it''s taken in a huge indoor tank - kinda like the one they used to film "Titanic" in - as if the water just drops off in front of a solid backdrop. It also has to do with the quality of the light - the moon seems more like a studio spot light.</td>', 'It''s a great shot. Has had me looking at it for ages.The way the colours of the water and the sky blend into one another make it look like it''s taken in a huge indoor tank - kinda like the one they used to film "Titanic" in - as if the water just drops off in front of a solid backdrop. It also has to do with the quality of the light - the moon seems more like a studio spot light.', '2006-06-21 12:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2536321, 348886, 58048, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nicely executed.<br/>Too bad the arms overlap.</td>', 'Good idea and nicely executed.Too bad the arms overlap.', '2006-06-21 12:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
