(2537043, 350991, 23913, '<td valign="top">the accessive neatimage/smoothing for nosie reduction really kills this image to me. as well as the fact that it is not very strong compositionaly the leading line in the image (the rail) takes you eye to the center where no subject is found....the subject have been split to one side or the other.<br/> <br/>IMHO would be stronger if you had picked a side to shoot. and put the rail eigther accross at the bottom of the image...(in the case of the solider field as the subject) or the rail running down the right side looking over the raod toward the city.<br/> <br/>in any event it is a passible shot for the challenge but it won''t get more than a 5 from me due to the above mentioned reasons.</td>', 'the accessive neatimage/smoothing for nosie reduction really kills this image to me. as well as the fact that it is not very strong compositionaly the leading line in the image (the rail) takes you eye to the center where no subject is found....the subject have been split to one side or the other. IMHO would be stronger if you had picked a side to shoot. and put the rail eigther accross at the bottom of the image...(in the case of the solider field as the subject) or the rail running down the right side looking over the raod toward the city. in any event it is a passible shot for the challenge but it won''t get more than a 5 from me due to the above mentioned reasons.', '2006-06-21 15:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
