(2537606, 351063, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I think the colours are too fake looking but you know what I like? I love that the water is in the shape of Africa.  Not sure if you planned the composition that way, but the red and orange colours compliment that shape. If that shape were not there the colours would not mean so much, now they take on a meaning of the hot African sun, etc. Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting. I think the colours are too fake looking but you know what I like? I love that the water is in the shape of Africa.  Not sure if you planned the composition that way, but the red and orange colours compliment that shape. If that shape were not there the colours would not mean so much, now they take on a meaning of the hot African sun, etc. Well done.', '2006-06-21 18:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
