(2537896, 348886, 47541, '<td valign="top">This is very similar to the shot I was planning on submitting for this challenge but I couldnt get the lighting right as I''ve only got the inbuilt flash!  I think that it would have come out a bit better if you had managed not to have an overlap of the arms as that seems to "give away" how the scene is created.  Also, the lighting on the right person is slightly different to the other two - other than that I like it.<br/> <br/>For my interest could you describe your setup for this photo please?</td>', 'This is very similar to the shot I was planning on submitting for this challenge but I couldnt get the lighting right as I''ve only got the inbuilt flash!  I think that it would have come out a bit better if you had managed not to have an overlap of the arms as that seems to "give away" how the scene is created.  Also, the lighting on the right person is slightly different to the other two - other than that I like it. For my interest could you describe your setup for this photo please?', '2006-06-21 19:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
