(2539866, 350846, 40019, '<td valign="top">Red Skies at Night  I loved The Fixx!  Great 80s band!  This image has a surreal appeal to it, very cool!  The grass in the foreground provides some nice textures in contrast to the glassy water.  Nice image  good luck!</td>', 'Red Skies at Night  I loved The Fixx!  Great 80s band!  This image has a surreal appeal to it, very cool!  The grass in the foreground provides some nice textures in contrast to the glassy water.  Nice image  good luck!', '2006-06-22 04:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
