(2539967, 350581, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, love that smooth reflection.  However, it´s very flat contrast wise and if you boosted up the contrast in the raw conversion or used the curves tool to make it more "s-shaped" this photo would "pop" so much more.  Composition is very nice but two things that could improve it slightly, I would have included slightly more of the water and less of the sky, like a 2-3 degree tilt downwards and the same to the right as the boat that is cutt off at the right side somehow bothers me, I would have liked to see all of that in the shot. Anyway, nice work, keep it up :)</td>', 'This is a nice shot, love that smooth reflection.  However, it´s very flat contrast wise and if you boosted up the contrast in the raw conversion or used the curves tool to make it more "s-shaped" this photo would "pop" so much more.  Composition is very nice but two things that could improve it slightly, I would have included slightly more of the water and less of the sky, like a 2-3 degree tilt downwards and the same to the right as the boat that is cutt off at the right side somehow bothers me, I would have liked to see all of that in the shot. Anyway, nice work, keep it up :)', '2006-06-22 05:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
