(2540386, 349873, 24073, '<td valign="top">gotta love these photos.  GL.  One thing though, did you pick a name that is scientific termy.  &lt;---nice word right?  Anyway is there a more common name for the constellation, like maybe a layman term?</td>', 'gotta love these photos.  GL.  One thing though, did you pick a name that is scientific termy.  <---nice word right?  Anyway is there a more common name for the constellation, like maybe a layman term?', '2006-06-22 10:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540389, 348911, 18485, '<td valign="top">cool shot nice title</td>', 'cool shot nice title', '2006-06-22 10:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540398, 349801, 24073, '<td valign="top">Seattle!  One of these days, one of these days.  I cant wait to see how this one finishes, I am also anxious to see your aperature setting.  I''m wondering how this would of looked just a tad bit darker.</td>', 'Seattle!  One of these days, one of these days.  I cant wait to see how this one finishes, I am also anxious to see your aperature setting.  I''m wondering how this would of looked just a tad bit darker.', '2006-06-22 10:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540425, 350626, 24073, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Its seems masterfully composed, and executed beautifully.  That small town in the background takes my mind away to wondering what life could be like there.  TY, and GL.</td>', 'Love it.  Its seems masterfully composed, and executed beautifully.  That small town in the background takes my mind away to wondering what life could be like there.  TY, and GL.', '2006-06-22 10:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540451, 350136, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great job, beautiful subdued photo!  If this doesnt qualify for a top 10 spot it would probably be more a composition/subject issue than a technical issue.  GL.</td>', 'Great job, beautiful subdued photo!  If this doesnt qualify for a top 10 spot it would probably be more a composition/subject issue than a technical issue.  GL.', '2006-06-22 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540460, 350177, 24073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, I have an idea similar to this one I am going to try and execute, I can only hope my turns out as well as yours.  Great Job, GL.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, I have an idea similar to this one I am going to try and execute, I can only hope my turns out as well as yours.  Great Job, GL.', '2006-06-22 10:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540480, 349901, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is unique, so that scores well in my book always.  Then the colors are fantastic, which scores another point, and the border is well applied, another point.  Overall, very nice high scoring image.  GL.</td>', 'This is unique, so that scores well in my book always.  Then the colors are fantastic, which scores another point, and the border is well applied, another point.  Overall, very nice high scoring image.  GL.', '2006-06-22 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540494, 349519, 24073, '<td valign="top">The colors aren''t working for me.  Great capture, but the greens gotta go.</td>', 'The colors aren''t working for me.  Great capture, but the greens gotta go.', '2006-06-22 10:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540503, 350028, 53859, '<td valign="top">sweet jebus how did you do that</td>', 'sweet jebus how did you do that', '2006-06-22 10:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540506, 349134, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great colors, love the gold and reddish orange together.</td>', 'Great colors, love the gold and reddish orange together.', '2006-06-22 10:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
