(2540918, 350099, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, I like the smoothness but would prefer seeing just a little more of the area above the water and to the left a little.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, I like the smoothness but would prefer seeing just a little more of the area above the water and to the left a little.', '2006-06-22 12:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
