(2540927, 349689, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow. <br/> <br/>Brilliant. The lighting is cool, the colors are pretty, the way to sky blends with the water is interesting. Very nice.</td>', 'Wow.  Brilliant. The lighting is cool, the colors are pretty, the way to sky blends with the water is interesting. Very nice.', '2006-06-22 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
