(2540939, 350294, 52439, '<td valign="top">I''m abit torn on this entry, i like the highlights and the subtleness of it, but there just isn''t quite enough there for me, assuming my monitor is calibrated right.</td>', 'I''m abit torn on this entry, i like the highlights and the subtleness of it, but there just isn''t quite enough there for me, assuming my monitor is calibrated right.', '2006-06-22 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
