(2540948, 349419, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow! Gorgeous! The glow of the sun and sky, and the surreal misty look of the water are truly fabulous. Wait! Are those really people on the rock? I didn''t even see them until now. It''s like Where''s Waldo, kind of. :) But really, are those statues, or real people??<br/> <br/>This could be a real winner.</td>', 'Wow! Gorgeous! The glow of the sun and sky, and the surreal misty look of the water are truly fabulous. Wait! Are those really people on the rock? I didn''t even see them until now. It''s like Where''s Waldo, kind of. :) But really, are those statues, or real people?? This could be a real winner.', '2006-06-22 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540951, 350742, 52439, '<td valign="top">Interesting but i dont think the close crop helps with this shot.</td>', 'Interesting but i dont think the close crop helps with this shot.', '2006-06-22 12:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2540953, 350843, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image. The big sky, the smooth water, and the sharp rocks make a really pretty image.</td>', 'Gorgeous image. The big sky, the smooth water, and the sharp rocks make a really pretty image.', '2006-06-22 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
