(2540958, 350155, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, love this shot. The smoothness of the flame is great, and how it highlights the logs from inside.<br/>Great exposure levels. My only gripe would be the lack of contrast and perhaps the logs could of been sharper.</td>', 'Wow, love this shot. The smoothness of the flame is great, and how it highlights the logs from inside.Great exposure levels. My only gripe would be the lack of contrast and perhaps the logs could of been sharper.', '2006-06-22 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
