(2540984, 350884, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, they let you take a camera into a movie theater? Don''t let them catch you... they''ll take it away and cast you into the dungeon.<br/> <br/>Anyway, nice photo, the lights on the wall are cool, and the contrast between the red light and the blue light on the wall is interesting.</td>', 'Wow, they let you take a camera into a movie theater? Don''t let them catch you... they''ll take it away and cast you into the dungeon. Anyway, nice photo, the lights on the wall are cool, and the contrast between the red light and the blue light on the wall is interesting.', '2006-06-22 13:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541036, 349938, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Thank you for haveing a level horizon.</td>', 'Great capture. Thank you for haveing a level horizon.', '2006-06-22 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541043, 348357, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, like the overall composition and how you have the bridge come out of the upper right. I also like the shadow in the water. <br/> <br/>Rich</td>', 'Very interesting shot, like the overall composition and how you have the bridge come out of the upper right. I also like the shadow in the water.  Rich', '2006-06-22 13:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
