(2541402, 350416, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a very attractive abstract image ;the bright bold colours are very effective, and it gives the appearance of a painting as opposed to a photograph - or even an image generated from a computer it has that much of an unearthly unnatural feel about it.  i like this very much, and is an exquisite use of a super-long exposure.  well done - 9.</td>', 'this is a very attractive abstract image ;the bright bold colours are very effective, and it gives the appearance of a painting as opposed to a photograph - or even an image generated from a computer it has that much of an unearthly unnatural feel about it.  i like this very much, and is an exquisite use of a super-long exposure.  well done - 9.', '2006-06-22 15:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541406, 349084, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a bit barmy, and i can only imagine some poor bugger being made to run and jump about with a torch.  i hope you bought them fish and chips after.  it''s a wonderful picture, though the town in the background is a bit unfortunate.  i love how the light is reflected on the beach and the blue / rocky outcrop thing at the back is gorgeous.  it''s a wonderful composition - 10.</td>', 'this is a bit barmy, and i can only imagine some poor bugger being made to run and jump about with a torch.  i hope you bought them fish and chips after.  it''s a wonderful picture, though the town in the background is a bit unfortunate.  i love how the light is reflected on the beach and the blue / rocky outcrop thing at the back is gorgeous.  it''s a wonderful composition - 10.', '2006-06-22 15:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541455, 348950, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and execution of it. The red background and light work well.</td>', 'I like your idea and execution of it. The red background and light work well.', '2006-06-22 15:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541459, 349938, 23098, '<td valign="top">Good catches!</td>', 'Good catches!', '2006-06-22 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541463, 349232, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, creates a pensive mood.</td>', 'I like this a lot, creates a pensive mood.', '2006-06-22 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541668, 349572, 48717, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this photo, and the sepia treatment, it adds to the timelessness of the photo.  The only change I would make would be to crop out the over blown sky in the upper left.  It pulls my eye up and away.</td>', 'I really like the concept of this photo, and the sepia treatment, it adds to the timelessness of the photo.  The only change I would make would be to crop out the over blown sky in the upper left.  It pulls my eye up and away.', '2006-06-22 16:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541762, 350213, 48717, '<td valign="top">Clever, but I had to dig out a dictionary.  Others voting may not go through those lengths.  Nice B&amp;W, I like the grain, it adds to the mood of the pic. Good Luck.</td>', 'Clever, but I had to dig out a dictionary.  Others voting may not go through those lengths.  Nice B&W, I like the grain, it adds to the mood of the pic. Good Luck.', '2006-06-22 17:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541842, 348351, 48717, '<td valign="top">Is this really a 30 second exposure? Those are really hard to do in bright sun, if so good job.  But, perhaps it was entered into the wrong competition.</td>', 'Is this really a 30 second exposure? Those are really hard to do in bright sun, if so good job.  But, perhaps it was entered into the wrong competition.', '2006-06-22 17:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541875, 347944, 48717, '<td valign="top">Creative, the colors and exposure are good, but it is a tad oof.  My only suggestion would have been a composition on thirds therfore cropping out the right third of the pic where the bright street is.  It pulls my eye away from the subject and does not add to the picture.</td>', 'Creative, the colors and exposure are good, but it is a tad oof.  My only suggestion would have been a composition on thirds therfore cropping out the right third of the pic where the bright street is.  It pulls my eye away from the subject and does not add to the picture.', '2006-06-22 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541954, 347944, 43565, '<td valign="top">I wish the tree and person were not so centered, but I really like the effect.</td>', 'I wish the tree and person were not so centered, but I really like the effect.', '2006-06-22 17:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
