(2543093, 350099, 46336, '<td valign="top">I see what you''ve tried to do here, but don''t think it has worked - the image as a whole comes across as too soft. I think it would have worked better with static objects more in the foreground and the soft water less prominent. I would like to try a shot like this myself.</td>', 'I see what you''ve tried to do here, but don''t think it has worked - the image as a whole comes across as too soft. I think it would have worked better with static objects more in the foreground and the soft water less prominent. I would like to try a shot like this myself.', '2006-06-22 23:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543099, 350111, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject and strongly composed.  Most would of gone with a gothic looking photo with this subject, I kind of like how you kept this with more naturally processed.  It seems just right, great work!</td>', 'Very interesting subject and strongly composed.  Most would of gone with a gothic looking photo with this subject, I kind of like how you kept this with more naturally processed.  It seems just right, great work!', '2006-06-22 23:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543100, 350147, 42100, '<td valign="top">Unique angle to the composition, but looks cool.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Unique angle to the composition, but looks cool.  Nicely done!', '2006-06-22 23:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543106, 350408, 42100, '<td valign="top">I love the rich vivid blue color and the sky has great interest.  The horizon looks good just a hair below center.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the rich vivid blue color and the sky has great interest.  The horizon looks good just a hair below center.  Well done!', '2006-06-22 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543116, 350177, 42100, '<td valign="top">Interesting curves to this, very well exposed and fascinating photo.</td>', 'Interesting curves to this, very well exposed and fascinating photo.', '2006-06-22 23:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
