(2544366, 349954, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, just needs abit more impact i think.<br/>Could be abit more saturation. Is it tilted abit aswell or is that my eyes?</td>', 'Nice shot, just needs abit more impact i think.Could be abit more saturation. Is it tilted abit aswell or is that my eyes?', '2006-06-23 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544371, 351000, 52439, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot, it''s a great IR shot.<br/>There does seem to be a haze centered in the picture though, not sure if it''s intentional but it is very off putting. <br/>Not a bad idea to keep the sky blue either, would of liked to see more of it though seen as it looks so nice.<br/>:)</td>', 'I do like this shot, it''s a great IR shot.There does seem to be a haze centered in the picture though, not sure if it''s intentional but it is very off putting. Not a bad idea to keep the sky blue either, would of liked to see more of it though seen as it looks so nice.:)', '2006-06-23 08:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
