(2544437, 350626, 23953, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of the image. I think the ridge in which the cars are coming at you (left lane), the headlights are a little hot and leads the eye to that which takes away from the image.</td>', 'I like the feeling of the image. I think the ridge in which the cars are coming at you (left lane), the headlights are a little hot and leads the eye to that which takes away from the image.', '2006-06-23 08:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
