(2544441, 348351, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is possibly one of the stranger submissions this week...  given that it seems to be taken in sunlight in a desert, the technical skill involved in getting a good quality snap with a 30 second exposure must be commended.  the colours are very nice.  not too sure about what is going on though - it feels like something from an academic text book, or a holiday snap from a security guard.  i like it in that i''m perplexed as to what to make of it.  the grooves in the columns are interesting, and i do wonder if there is a story behind that.  but generally, i get the unfortunate impression that you accidentally submitted the wrong photo.  gave it a 4.</td>', 'this is possibly one of the stranger submissions this week...  given that it seems to be taken in sunlight in a desert, the technical skill involved in getting a good quality snap with a 30 second exposure must be commended.  the colours are very nice.  not too sure about what is going on though - it feels like something from an academic text book, or a holiday snap from a security guard.  i like it in that i''m perplexed as to what to make of it.  the grooves in the columns are interesting, and i do wonder if there is a story behind that.  but generally, i get the unfortunate impression that you accidentally submitted the wrong photo.  gave it a 4.', '2006-06-23 08:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544442, 349801, 35947, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.  Can''t think of anything that could improve this!  Great coloring in the sky!</td>', 'Amazing shot.  Can''t think of anything that could improve this!  Great coloring in the sky!', '2006-06-23 08:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544443, 350846, 23953, '<td valign="top">I am sure the intention was to leave a lot of negative space on the top of the frame. IMO, it is too much. I like the many different layers of the shot from the green grass, the blue water, the tan/orange hillside to the left, to the redish sky. Overall a pretty good image.</td>', 'I am sure the intention was to leave a lot of negative space on the top of the frame. IMO, it is too much. I like the many different layers of the shot from the green grass, the blue water, the tan/orange hillside to the left, to the redish sky. Overall a pretty good image.', '2006-06-23 08:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544444, 349888, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love this!  The sky looks cool and I love the composition of the city to the palm trees.</td>', 'Love this!  The sky looks cool and I love the composition of the city to the palm trees.', '2006-06-23 08:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544448, 350511, 23953, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the falls. IMO, 30 seconds is too long for this image. The spray from the falls causes a fog effect blocking the viewer from seeing the subject.</td>', 'Nice shot of the falls. IMO, 30 seconds is too long for this image. The spray from the falls causes a fog effect blocking the viewer from seeing the subject.', '2006-06-23 08:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544450, 349901, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is sooper groovy.  the slight bit of blur on the car (specifically on the rings and the front number plate) are the only things stopping audi phoning you up to put it in the a8 brochure.  totally intrigued by how you achieved the wavy lines, as it gives a fantastic impression of speed and gives the car tremendous presence.  the lighting, angle, colours, crop, subject matter are all fantastic.  it also makes good use of the 30-sec exposure element of the challenge.  very easy 10.</td>', 'this is sooper groovy.  the slight bit of blur on the car (specifically on the rings and the front number plate) are the only things stopping audi phoning you up to put it in the a8 brochure.  totally intrigued by how you achieved the wavy lines, as it gives a fantastic impression of speed and gives the car tremendous presence.  the lighting, angle, colours, crop, subject matter are all fantastic.  it also makes good use of the 30-sec exposure element of the challenge.  very easy 10.', '2006-06-23 08:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544451, 349759, 23953, '<td valign="top">Good exposure for the shot but that white block in the middle of the frame is so distracting; it leads the viewer right to that spot.</td>', 'Good exposure for the shot but that white block in the middle of the frame is so distracting; it leads the viewer right to that spot.', '2006-06-23 08:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544455, 349854, 23953, '<td valign="top">Good effect of the streaking head and tail lights. It leads the viewer into the frame.</td>', 'Good effect of the streaking head and tail lights. It leads the viewer into the frame.', '2006-06-23 08:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544458, 349496, 16004, '<td valign="top">some noise reduction, a fiddle with the levels, upping the contrast and lowering the brightness might make this appear a little less undefined and washed out.  a lower f number on the aperture might also hide more of the slopdges that appear to be on your lens or sensor.</td>', 'some noise reduction, a fiddle with the levels, upping the contrast and lowering the brightness might make this appear a little less undefined and washed out.  a lower f number on the aperture might also hide more of the slopdges that appear to be on your lens or sensor.', '2006-06-23 08:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544464, 350798, 16004, '<td valign="top">how the bloody hell did you do this??  it''s very clever...  the only reral criticism i have is that the lights from the buildings are a little blown, but that''s relatively minor.  the vortex itself is genius, and the reflections in the water are very pleasing. impressed.  8.</td>', 'how the bloody hell did you do this??  it''s very clever...  the only reral criticism i have is that the lights from the buildings are a little blown, but that''s relatively minor.  the vortex itself is genius, and the reflections in the water are very pleasing. impressed.  8.', '2006-06-23 09:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544471, 349758, 16004, '<td valign="top">the best things about this is the colours and the veyr high level of detail.  the slight feel of diffused lighting is nicely subtle and works pretty well.  main problem is i can''t quite understand how a longer exposure enhances the picture; just doesn''t say the shutter was open any longer than normal, really.  the crop is also a bit cramped and i think the overall impact suffers a little as a result.  it''s okay, but lacks that special oomph.  5.</td>', 'the best things about this is the colours and the veyr high level of detail.  the slight feel of diffused lighting is nicely subtle and works pretty well.  main problem is i can''t quite understand how a longer exposure enhances the picture; just doesn''t say the shutter was open any longer than normal, really.  the crop is also a bit cramped and i think the overall impact suffers a little as a result.  it''s okay, but lacks that special oomph.  5.', '2006-06-23 09:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544480, 350884, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like this a great deal and gave it a 9.  i especially love the rich bold coluors, and the way the lines draw you to where the stage / screen might be.  you should be applauded for finding something beautiful where most people wouldn''t see it.</td>', 'i like this a great deal and gave it a 9.  i especially love the rich bold coluors, and the way the lines draw you to where the stage / screen might be.  you should be applauded for finding something beautiful where most people wouldn''t see it.', '2006-06-23 09:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
