(2544484, 348543, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s nice as a still life, but i can''t quite see why it would warrant a thirty second exposure - i think in terms of the challenge that the shot should be obvious.  it also appears a little too cluttered and messy; maybe fewer pieces would enhance the overall impact?</td>', 'it''s nice as a still life, but i can''t quite see why it would warrant a thirty second exposure - i think in terms of the challenge that the shot should be obvious.  it also appears a little too cluttered and messy; maybe fewer pieces would enhance the overall impact?', '2006-06-23 09:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
