(2544501, 351063, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot I like, really like.  Normally I hate blurry photos but this one just really speaks to me, something with the mix of coloring, composition and most definately the mood in it really gets to me.  I don´t think you are scoring well though as this is not a typical "do well on dpc" photo, I hope you are though but for what it´s worth, it got a 10 from me and wound up on my favorites list.</td>', 'This shot I like, really like.  Normally I hate blurry photos but this one just really speaks to me, something with the mix of coloring, composition and most definately the mood in it really gets to me.  I don´t think you are scoring well though as this is not a typical "do well on dpc" photo, I hope you are though but for what it´s worth, it got a 10 from me and wound up on my favorites list.', '2006-06-23 09:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
