(2545126, 349888, 60995, '<td valign="top">Love the battle of nature vs. city, beach vs. buildings.  Both are beautiful--each in their own way.  Great perspective, framing, lighting, sky.</td>', 'Love the battle of nature vs. city, beach vs. buildings.  Both are beautiful--each in their own way.  Great perspective, framing, lighting, sky.', '2006-06-23 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
