(2545128, 350999, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like the strong contrast and colors, not as fond of the WHITE backround, think if the backround would have been the same as the mirror the glasses are lying on, this would have been a killer shot :)  Still good and got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Cool shot, I like the strong contrast and colors, not as fond of the WHITE backround, think if the backround would have been the same as the mirror the glasses are lying on, this would have been a killer shot :)  Still good and got a 7 from me.', '2006-06-23 13:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
