(2545130, 349646, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but way too dark for my taste, and yes, my screen is calibrated so if this is bright for you, you might want to check out your screen settings.</td>', 'Sorry but way too dark for my taste, and yes, my screen is calibrated so if this is bright for you, you might want to check out your screen settings.', '2006-06-23 13:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2545134, 350798, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can´t for the life of me figure out how this shot is taken but that doesn´t meen that I like it, the "vortex" is very disorienting and not really aesthetically pleasing, I get slightly dizzy looking at this shot.  Still, I appreciate the effort so I gave it a 6.</td>', 'I can´t for the life of me figure out how this shot is taken but that doesn´t meen that I like it, the "vortex" is very disorienting and not really aesthetically pleasing, I get slightly dizzy looking at this shot.  Still, I appreciate the effort so I gave it a 6.', '2006-06-23 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
