(2545143, 348950, 27482, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool, I like the idea, just think that a kitchen sink isn´t the best setting for a shot like this, I can just see this done on a tabletop and water all around, maybe with a black and white square cloth (like a chessboard) and something around the glass, like smaller glasses or something like that...  6 from me.</td>', 'Kind of cool, I like the idea, just think that a kitchen sink isn´t the best setting for a shot like this, I can just see this done on a tabletop and water all around, maybe with a black and white square cloth (like a chessboard) and something around the glass, like smaller glasses or something like that...  6 from me.', '2006-06-23 13:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2545144, 349978, 60995, '<td valign="top">Oww. Hurts my eyes b/c it is so bright and blurry.</td>', 'Oww. Hurts my eyes b/c it is so bright and blurry.', '2006-06-23 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2545146, 349854, 27482, '<td valign="top">Been done a million times already but that doesn´t really matter when it´s done well, like it´s done here.  Nice shot, nothing spectacular about it though but shot at the correct time of day with nice composition.  Gave it a 6.</td>', 'Been done a million times already but that doesn´t really matter when it´s done well, like it´s done here.  Nice shot, nothing spectacular about it though but shot at the correct time of day with nice composition.  Gave it a 6.', '2006-06-23 13:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
