(2545177, 348969, 27482, '<td valign="top">I gotta put a question mark about the portrait orientation of this shot, to me it would have been much more natural to have this in landscape orientation and show a little bit what´s around this interesting building instead of including so much of the water and sky wich I think don´t do much for this building.  If you still want portrait orientation I would suggest not having the subject so in the middle next time, try putting it either higher or lower in the frame.  That said though I like this shot as it is and think it´s above average, gave it a 6.</td>', 'I gotta put a question mark about the portrait orientation of this shot, to me it would have been much more natural to have this in landscape orientation and show a little bit what´s around this interesting building instead of including so much of the water and sky wich I think don´t do much for this building.  If you still want portrait orientation I would suggest not having the subject so in the middle next time, try putting it either higher or lower in the frame.  That said though I like this shot as it is and think it´s above average, gave it a 6.', '2006-06-23 13:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
