(2545197, 348832, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, not really fond of the blue hue on this one, think I would have liked it better with a more neutral hue, the sky more black and "natural" but this is still pretty good.  Wish there was something in the foreground that stood out more with some kind of illumination but I guess "painting with light" doesn´t work on those mountains, hehe :)  Nice work anyway, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Pretty cool, not really fond of the blue hue on this one, think I would have liked it better with a more neutral hue, the sky more black and "natural" but this is still pretty good.  Wish there was something in the foreground that stood out more with some kind of illumination but I guess "painting with light" doesn´t work on those mountains, hehe :)  Nice work anyway, gave it a 7.', '2006-06-23 13:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2545201, 348910, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for a long exposure image when it is hard to remain still for so long. Composition and framing are fine but the yellow/red color cast is too strong. If you uses Hue/Sat and selective color for color correction colors will be mted but look better. But then you can desat completely with another hue/Sat layer then add a last Layers adjustment you can make a really decent B&amp;W image out of this. That might fit the theme of this image much better.</td>', 'Interesting choice for a long exposure image when it is hard to remain still for so long. Composition and framing are fine but the yellow/red color cast is too strong. If you uses Hue/Sat and selective color for color correction colors will be mted but look better. But then you can desat completely with another hue/Sat layer then add a last Layers adjustment you can make a really decent B&W image out of this. That might fit the theme of this image much better.', '2006-06-23 13:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2545204, 348412, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, I like the symmetrial pattern, it really draws me in, I guess I must be a pyromaniac :)</td>', 'This is pretty cool, I like the symmetrial pattern, it really draws me in, I guess I must be a pyromaniac :)', '2006-06-23 13:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
