(2546530, 350982, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract image. One of the better examples resulting from camera movement.</td>', 'Interesting abstract image. One of the better examples resulting from camera movement.', '2006-06-23 20:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546537, 349019, 18197, '<td valign="top">The degree of difficulty here is high. In the end, it feels over exposed to me. And the flame is blown out. Perhaps a neutral density filter would have allowed you to cool the image and save some of the flame detail.</td>', 'The degree of difficulty here is high. In the end, it feels over exposed to me. And the flame is blown out. Perhaps a neutral density filter would have allowed you to cool the image and save some of the flame detail.', '2006-06-23 20:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546542, 348170, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yep, Ikea glassware for sure. The best photos IMO are the conjunction of a great subject and great technical execution. Execution here is okay, but the subject doesn''t resonate with me. Sorry.</td>', 'Yep, Ikea glassware for sure. The best photos IMO are the conjunction of a great subject and great technical execution. Execution here is okay, but the subject doesn''t resonate with me. Sorry.', '2006-06-23 20:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546558, 350916, 18197, '<td valign="top">Might have done better in the Indulgence challenge. Looks like you might have switched challenges at the end. Subject is fine, mirrors are interesting, the photo hints at a story which could be intriguing. But the photo seems over exposed to me. This gives a brassy rather than a golden tone to everything and cheapens the "indulgence" of it. Further, there are some great shadows here but the exposure washes them out. I hope this doesn''t sound overly negative. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Might have done better in the Indulgence challenge. Looks like you might have switched challenges at the end. Subject is fine, mirrors are interesting, the photo hints at a story which could be intriguing. But the photo seems over exposed to me. This gives a brassy rather than a golden tone to everything and cheapens the "indulgence" of it. Further, there are some great shadows here but the exposure washes them out. I hope this doesn''t sound overly negative. Just my opinion.', '2006-06-23 20:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546574, 349978, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think you have the makings of a fine photo here. The main problem (IMHO) is that it''s over exposed. Maybe a lower ISO and/or smaller aperture would have helped, or possibly a neutral density filter. The reflections would then be visible (one of the photos strongest elements.) If it were me I would crop the bottom 10% of the image losing the dark line. Sorry to sound negative. Just my opinion.</td>', 'I think you have the makings of a fine photo here. The main problem (IMHO) is that it''s over exposed. Maybe a lower ISO and/or smaller aperture would have helped, or possibly a neutral density filter. The reflections would then be visible (one of the photos strongest elements.) If it were me I would crop the bottom 10% of the image losing the dark line. Sorry to sound negative. Just my opinion.', '2006-06-23 20:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546590, 350693, 18197, '<td valign="top">A great photo occurs when a great subject combines with great execution. In this case the execution is fine, but the subject does nothing for me. It''s not that it''s a bad photo, but rather a photo of a subject I don''t want to look at. I am sure this sounds negative. Sorry.</td>', 'A great photo occurs when a great subject combines with great execution. In this case the execution is fine, but the subject does nothing for me. It''s not that it''s a bad photo, but rather a photo of a subject I don''t want to look at. I am sure this sounds negative. Sorry.', '2006-06-23 20:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546593, 349759, 39900, '<td valign="top">OMG best so far... i give u 9</td>', 'OMG best so far... i give u 9', '2006-06-23 20:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546599, 351032, 39900, '<td valign="top">8 :P</td>', '8 :P', '2006-06-23 20:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546607, 350213, 18197, '<td valign="top">You succeeded in creating an emotional response in me. I don''t want to be here, that''s for sure. You hint at a story (which I like). Why is this person here? For how long? Why is he (she?) wearing a wedding ring? I can see this in Newsweek or Time, or some such. I think the title diminishes the photo. You could have used the title to continue to tell the story.</td>', 'You succeeded in creating an emotional response in me. I don''t want to be here, that''s for sure. You hint at a story (which I like). Why is this person here? For how long? Why is he (she?) wearing a wedding ring? I can see this in Newsweek or Time, or some such. I think the title diminishes the photo. You could have used the title to continue to tell the story.', '2006-06-23 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546615, 351030, 18197, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion. Poor photo with a title in poor taste.</td>', 'Just my opinion. Poor photo with a title in poor taste.', '2006-06-23 20:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546641, 349758, 59926, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!</td>', 'Great shot!!', '2006-06-23 21:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546773, 350620, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines, I think the distortion from the wide angle lens actually adds to the pic, I am sure you will get comments that say the opposite, but I feel it really works well here.</td>', 'Nice leading lines, I think the distortion from the wide angle lens actually adds to the pic, I am sure you will get comments that say the opposite, but I feel it really works well here.', '2006-06-23 21:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546775, 349742, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, just a little soft on the focus though.</td>', 'Nice pic, just a little soft on the focus though.', '2006-06-23 21:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546781, 350294, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, and I see where you were going with it, but I feel it needs a wee little more light.</td>', 'Nice pic, and I see where you were going with it, but I feel it needs a wee little more light.', '2006-06-23 21:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546794, 349888, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, I like the tone of the b&amp;w.  It almost looks like you used a flash to illuminate the foreground, you have a hot spot on the first tree, but I don''t think you needed it.  Perhaps it is coming from street lights.</td>', 'Nice pic, I like the tone of the b&w.  It almost looks like you used a flash to illuminate the foreground, you have a hot spot on the first tree, but I don''t think you needed it.  Perhaps it is coming from street lights.', '2006-06-23 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546815, 349441, 48717, '<td valign="top">OK, this made me laugh.  Wish the focus were not so soft.  The pic is also tilted a bit.  Both easy enough to fix, so I anticipate if your next entry is sharp and straight your score will improve.</td>', 'OK, this made me laugh.  Wish the focus were not so soft.  The pic is also tilted a bit.  Both easy enough to fix, so I anticipate if your next entry is sharp and straight your score will improve.', '2006-06-23 21:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546830, 351000, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, good composition, but the drain pipe throws off the continuity and the focus may be a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice pic, good composition, but the drain pipe throws off the continuity and the focus may be a bit soft.', '2006-06-23 21:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546855, 350616, 48717, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Who has invaded MY city!!!  You went after 11pm, if you had gone before the antennae on the tower would have been lit.  Good composition, it is a tad dark, making it hard to distinguish the buildings from the sky in places, but good job otherwise.</td>', 'Hey!  Who has invaded MY city!!!  You went after 11pm, if you had gone before the antennae on the tower would have been lit.  Good composition, it is a tad dark, making it hard to distinguish the buildings from the sky in places, but good job otherwise.', '2006-06-23 21:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546862, 349943, 48717, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at this and it is just going over my head.  I cannot make it out.</td>', 'I keep looking at this and it is just going over my head.  I cannot make it out.', '2006-06-23 21:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546873, 350028, 48717, '<td valign="top">Best "me, myself, and I pic" in this challenge!!  Thanks for doing a good job.  The flash may be harsh in places, but overall not so bad.</td>', 'Best "me, myself, and I pic" in this challenge!!  Thanks for doing a good job.  The flash may be harsh in places, but overall not so bad.', '2006-06-23 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
