(2546905, 350041, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great shot, wondrerful calming effect.<br/> <br/>Colorful lights and nice composition.</td>', 'Great shot, wondrerful calming effect. Colorful lights and nice composition.', '2006-06-23 22:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546911, 348969, 49556, '<td valign="top">nicely done. love the colors</td>', 'nicely done. love the colors', '2006-06-23 22:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546919, 350044, 49556, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sight! Love the colors!</td>', 'Beautiful sight! Love the colors!', '2006-06-23 22:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546921, 350991, 10818, '<td valign="top">Excellent city shot.  Great focus, and a super sky.</td>', 'Excellent city shot.  Great focus, and a super sky.', '2006-06-23 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546922, 349978, 48717, '<td valign="top">Well, where do I start.  Looks like this really had the potential be be a nice shot.  You chose a beautiful skyline to work with.  But...it is overexposed, and blurry.  Not knowing what your camera settings were other than a 30" shutter I cannot say what you should do to fix the exposure.  But, if you were not using the largest aperature setting, i.e. ~29, that would be a start.  As for the focus, if you were not using a tripod or another stable surface, try that next time.  Correcting those two things would improve this pic 100 fold.</td>', 'Well, where do I start.  Looks like this really had the potential be be a nice shot.  You chose a beautiful skyline to work with.  But...it is overexposed, and blurry.  Not knowing what your camera settings were other than a 30" shutter I cannot say what you should do to fix the exposure.  But, if you were not using the largest aperature setting, i.e. ~29, that would be a start.  As for the focus, if you were not using a tripod or another stable surface, try that next time.  Correcting those two things would improve this pic 100 fold.', '2006-06-23 22:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546928, 350846, 49556, '<td valign="top">Wow! Absolutely love the colors!</td>', 'Wow! Absolutely love the colors!', '2006-06-23 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546939, 350044, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is quite an incedible scene.  Beautiful sunset and colors.  Well done shot.</td>', 'That is quite an incedible scene.  Beautiful sunset and colors.  Well done shot.', '2006-06-23 22:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2546981, 350187, 51987, '<td valign="top">Wow! Interesting building!</td>', 'Wow! Interesting building!', '2006-06-23 22:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
