(2547398, 350938, 13688, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  I wish the foreground and background lighting levels were a little more balanced, as I find the background more interesting.  Especially that mountain on the far left.  That square thing lying in the foreground center seems out of place.</td>', 'Nice scene.  I wish the foreground and background lighting levels were a little more balanced, as I find the background more interesting.  Especially that mountain on the far left.  That square thing lying in the foreground center seems out of place.', '2006-06-24 00:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2547418, 350990, 13688, '<td valign="top">I really like the mood you''ve created.  I think the extreme highlight at the top really adds to the image.  I''m having some trouble with the balance of the composition though.  It''s hard to explain, but for me it seems alot of focus on the path is on the left side of the crack due to it lighter shade.  That seems to set my attention at the dead center of the image and i loose some of the photo''s dynamic potential.</td>', 'I really like the mood you''ve created.  I think the extreme highlight at the top really adds to the image.  I''m having some trouble with the balance of the composition though.  It''s hard to explain, but for me it seems alot of focus on the path is on the left side of the crack due to it lighter shade.  That seems to set my attention at the dead center of the image and i loose some of the photo''s dynamic potential.', '2006-06-24 00:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2547423, 350846, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice job capturing some very interesting conditions and taking care in the composition as well.</td>', 'nice job capturing some very interesting conditions and taking care in the composition as well.', '2006-06-24 00:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2547445, 349801, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice exposure.  I''ll nit pick and wonder if you could have moved slightly to the right so as to separate the needle from that other building behind it, as i believe it would have strengthened your composition</td>', 'nice exposure.  I''ll nit pick and wonder if you could have moved slightly to the right so as to separate the needle from that other building behind it, as i believe it would have strengthened your composition', '2006-06-24 00:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
