(2549504, 351057, 18197, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Christmas tree on acid. Interesting but not to my (current) taste.</td>', 'Looks like a Christmas tree on acid. Interesting but not to my (current) taste.', '2006-06-24 20:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549520, 348883, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am prepared to believe this was a 30 second exposure. It is technically well done and the degree of difficulty is fairly high. But in the words of Pinky and the Brain ...<br/> <br/>Brain, "Pinky, are your pondering what I''m pondering?"<br/>Pinky, "Well I thinks so Brain, but a Coke bottle for a subject? What would Mr. Adams think?"</td>', 'I am prepared to believe this was a 30 second exposure. It is technically well done and the degree of difficulty is fairly high. But in the words of Pinky and the Brain ... Brain, "Pinky, are your pondering what I''m pondering?"Pinky, "Well I thinks so Brain, but a Coke bottle for a subject? What would Mr. Adams think?"', '2006-06-24 20:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549568, 350023, 19944, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp and great color.</td>', 'Nice and sharp and great color.', '2006-06-24 20:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549569, 350973, 19944, '<td valign="top">Smoooooothe blue water.  Nice and sharp.  Good job.</td>', 'Smoooooothe blue water.  Nice and sharp.  Good job.', '2006-06-24 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549573, 349593, 19944, '<td valign="top">It is interesting that you got stars in the photo as well as having the face lit.  Quite interesting.</td>', 'It is interesting that you got stars in the photo as well as having the face lit.  Quite interesting.', '2006-06-24 20:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549575, 350546, 19944, '<td valign="top">To my eye, it seems a little dark and a little soft.</td>', 'To my eye, it seems a little dark and a little soft.', '2006-06-24 20:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549579, 350331, 19944, '<td valign="top">Sharp, sharp, sharp.  Nice starburst on the lights and excellent ghosting.</td>', 'Sharp, sharp, sharp.  Nice starburst on the lights and excellent ghosting.', '2006-06-24 20:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549601, 349441, 18197, '<td valign="top">I gave this a low score because you captured 3 of my photographic pet peeves in one photo: tilted towel bar; poor focus, and a toilet. It does show a sense of humor ... best we not take ourselves too seriously.</td>', 'I gave this a low score because you captured 3 of my photographic pet peeves in one photo: tilted towel bar; poor focus, and a toilet. It does show a sense of humor ... best we not take ourselves too seriously.', '2006-06-24 20:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549611, 348910, 18197, '<td valign="top">The lighting is flat and sepia toned. Was this a conscious choice? Greater contrast and multiple light sources would address the flat light. I am in awe of the models'' ability to hold perfectly still for 30 seconds or more. But in the end I''m not resonating with the photo. Guess you didn''t get lucky w/ me, either.</td>', 'The lighting is flat and sepia toned. Was this a conscious choice? Greater contrast and multiple light sources would address the flat light. I am in awe of the models'' ability to hold perfectly still for 30 seconds or more. But in the end I''m not resonating with the photo. Guess you didn''t get lucky w/ me, either.', '2006-06-24 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549944, 350511, 22656, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the US Falls from the Canadian side...</td>', 'Nice shot of the US Falls from the Canadian side...', '2006-06-24 22:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2550068, 348170, 50715, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this does nothing for me, even as an abstract. The flared light and blown highlights at the right dominate the photo, nothing is sharp but the out-of-focus aspect doesn''t look deliberate, there are lots of messy reflections or artifacts, particularly on the left object.</td>', 'Sorry, this does nothing for me, even as an abstract. The flared light and blown highlights at the right dominate the photo, nothing is sharp but the out-of-focus aspect doesn''t look deliberate, there are lots of messy reflections or artifacts, particularly on the left object.', '2006-06-24 23:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2550077, 349019, 50715, '<td valign="top">This would look better if any part of it was in focus - preferably the objects in the centre. But the flame has flared out and become a bit featureless. The bright area in the background is very distracting too. Try this one again, but with proper focus, repositioned to avoid the background problems, and a smaller aperture to reduce the light coming in which will give a bit more detail to the flame as well as making the uninteresting background disappear to black.</td>', 'This would look better if any part of it was in focus - preferably the objects in the centre. But the flame has flared out and become a bit featureless. The bright area in the background is very distracting too. Try this one again, but with proper focus, repositioned to avoid the background problems, and a smaller aperture to reduce the light coming in which will give a bit more detail to the flame as well as making the uninteresting background disappear to black.', '2006-06-24 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2550082, 349978, 50715, '<td valign="top">This is way too overexposed; the light flareouts are painful rather than pleasing, and the light grey featureless sky does nothing. A long exposure could work here, but you need a much smaller aperture to ensure less light gets in - try underexposing by half a stop or so. Also, cropt out a lot of the sky because it adds nothing (unless you get some features in it).</td>', 'This is way too overexposed; the light flareouts are painful rather than pleasing, and the light grey featureless sky does nothing. A long exposure could work here, but you need a much smaller aperture to ensure less light gets in - try underexposing by half a stop or so. Also, cropt out a lot of the sky because it adds nothing (unless you get some features in it).', '2006-06-24 23:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2550090, 348582, 50715, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the problem is - either it''s badly underexposed, or correctly exposued but no centre of interest, just a scene of random nothingness. Try this again with a more interesting scene, or adding even a bit more to some other parts of the scene to give the eye something to catch its attention.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the problem is - either it''s badly underexposed, or correctly exposued but no centre of interest, just a scene of random nothingness. Try this again with a more interesting scene, or adding even a bit more to some other parts of the scene to give the eye something to catch its attention.', '2006-06-24 23:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2550102, 351046, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice concept.  there are some hotspots on the car, and the sky seems oversharpened?</td>', 'nice concept.  there are some hotspots on the car, and the sky seems oversharpened?', '2006-06-24 23:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2550106, 350175, 59343, '<td valign="top">interesting idea.  looks like he''s floating.  i think this looks technically fine.</td>', 'interesting idea.  looks like he''s floating.  i think this looks technically fine.', '2006-06-24 23:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
