(2551836, 348762, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, I like the blue hue and the location you found here, seems like a place I´d like to visit.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, I like the blue hue and the location you found here, seems like a place I´d like to visit.', '2006-06-25 15:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551839, 350157, 27482, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit flat for my taste, if you had boosted up the contrast somewhat I would have liked it much more.</td>', 'Image is a bit flat for my taste, if you had boosted up the contrast somewhat I would have liked it much more.', '2006-06-25 15:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551847, 350187, 27482, '<td valign="top">Shame about that wierd dust spot in the sky, too bad this is just a basic editing challenge, otherwise I assume you would have removed it so I am not going to mark you down for it.  I like the colors and contrast in this one, I for one would have boosted the contrast a little bit further but it works like it is.  Nice composition. 7</td>', 'Shame about that wierd dust spot in the sky, too bad this is just a basic editing challenge, otherwise I assume you would have removed it so I am not going to mark you down for it.  I like the colors and contrast in this one, I for one would have boosted the contrast a little bit further but it works like it is.  Nice composition. 7', '2006-06-25 15:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551858, 350099, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I dislike this shot, using a long shutterspeed to capture water will just result in a blurry mess as is in this shot and you chose to have that blurry mess almost all of the photo, there is nothing really that draws the eye here but perhaps a leaf up in the right corner.  You might as well have put a plastic bag covering 75% of the lens and this shot would have looked identical.  Next time I suggest you have one stationary part in the middle of the moving water, classic choice is a rock or something that is the center of attention.</td>', 'Sorry but I dislike this shot, using a long shutterspeed to capture water will just result in a blurry mess as is in this shot and you chose to have that blurry mess almost all of the photo, there is nothing really that draws the eye here but perhaps a leaf up in the right corner.  You might as well have put a plastic bag covering 75% of the lens and this shot would have looked identical.  Next time I suggest you have one stationary part in the middle of the moving water, classic choice is a rock or something that is the center of attention.', '2006-06-25 15:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551862, 350224, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, very creative but the bottom line is the outcome and for me it´s not very aesthetically pleasing, image is way too busy for my taste and my eye isn´t drawn to any part of this photo.  5 from me.</td>', 'Sorry, very creative but the bottom line is the outcome and for me it´s not very aesthetically pleasing, image is way too busy for my taste and my eye isn´t drawn to any part of this photo.  5 from me.', '2006-06-25 15:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551876, 350620, 27482, '<td valign="top">Only two things I dislike about this shot and made me refrain from giving it a 10 and adding it to my favorites.<br/> <br/>1.  For my taste, oversharpened by quite a bit.<br/> <br/>2.  Strongly dislike the strong flare that is around every single lightsource in the image.<br/> <br/>Other than that, this shot is AWESOME, excellent clarity, contrast, coloring, composition and use of a wide angle lens.  Like I said, 9 from me :)</td>', 'Only two things I dislike about this shot and made me refrain from giving it a 10 and adding it to my favorites. 1.  For my taste, oversharpened by quite a bit. 2.  Strongly dislike the strong flare that is around every single lightsource in the image. Other than that, this shot is AWESOME, excellent clarity, contrast, coloring, composition and use of a wide angle lens.  Like I said, 9 from me :)', '2006-06-25 15:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551882, 350546, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I dislike the softfocus effect or lack of clarity to this shot, I would have liked it better if it were crystal clear and sharp.</td>', 'Sorry but I dislike the softfocus effect or lack of clarity to this shot, I would have liked it better if it were crystal clear and sharp.', '2006-06-25 15:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551889, 349399, 27482, '<td valign="top">Why do I get a hunch this is Terjes image?  If it is, not as good as your normal stuff but this is not really the season for this shots for us up north, still good though, love the simplicity of it and the coloring, so minimalistic.  Threw a 7 on it, nice work.</td>', 'Why do I get a hunch this is Terjes image?  If it is, not as good as your normal stuff but this is not really the season for this shots for us up north, still good though, love the simplicity of it and the coloring, so minimalistic.  Threw a 7 on it, nice work.', '2006-06-25 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551896, 349419, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is really cool, wonderful warmth and solitude.<br/> <br/>Its so wierd that tree looks like a lady stretching with her leg clasped to her arm.<br/> <br/>Awesome shot.</td>', 'That is really cool, wonderful warmth and solitude. Its so wierd that tree looks like a lady stretching with her leg clasped to her arm. Awesome shot.', '2006-06-25 16:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552089, 350990, 49672, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy softness, and while I''m not a big fan of the paved path, like this shot a lot.</td>', 'I like the dreamy softness, and while I''m not a big fan of the paved path, like this shot a lot.', '2006-06-25 17:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552096, 350798, 49672, '<td valign="top">What the heck is that?!  Great shot.</td>', 'What the heck is that?!  Great shot.', '2006-06-25 17:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552104, 349689, 33392, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful colors.  There is a rock in the moon''s reflection that almost looks like an eye.  One of my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful colors.  There is a rock in the moon''s reflection that almost looks like an eye.  One of my top picks for this challenge.', '2006-06-25 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552106, 350843, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, nice colors.  Too bad the lighthouse device is there.</td>', 'Very crisp, nice colors.  Too bad the lighthouse device is there.', '2006-06-25 17:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552107, 349106, 33392, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this.  The colors are a little off of what I would''ve expected, but this is still one of my top 5 picks this challenge.</td>', 'I love the feel of this.  The colors are a little off of what I would''ve expected, but this is still one of my top 5 picks this challenge.', '2006-06-25 17:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552110, 351000, 33392, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  What is the pipe-thing in the lower-right?  Did you try a crop that left that out?</td>', 'I like this alot.  What is the pipe-thing in the lower-right?  Did you try a crop that left that out?', '2006-06-25 17:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552112, 349399, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A real dreamy blue.</td>', 'Very nice.  A real dreamy blue.', '2006-06-25 17:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552116, 349873, 33392, '<td valign="top">I love these night shots.  This is very crisp.  I would be curious to know your ISO, etc.  I have built a scotch-mount to try this myself, but haven''t had the opportunity to try it out.</td>', 'I love these night shots.  This is very crisp.  I would be curious to know your ISO, etc.  I have built a scotch-mount to try this myself, but haven''t had the opportunity to try it out.', '2006-06-25 17:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552117, 348950, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea.  The board on top of the glass is a little off-center (IMO), but otherwise wonderful.</td>', 'Very nice idea.  The board on top of the glass is a little off-center (IMO), but otherwise wonderful.', '2006-06-25 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552120, 349854, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line, and wonderful colors.</td>', 'Nice leading line, and wonderful colors.', '2006-06-25 17:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552121, 349572, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia touch.  Love the ghosting.</td>', 'Nice sepia touch.  Love the ghosting.', '2006-06-25 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552124, 350511, 33392, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  You might try (for your own - not allowed in basic) boosting the exposure on the landscape above the falls.</td>', 'Beautiful.  You might try (for your own - not allowed in basic) boosting the exposure on the landscape above the falls.', '2006-06-25 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552126, 350053, 33392, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.  First impression is that it is tilted a bit to the right, but it''s probably an illusion due to the bridge''s shape.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the colors.  First impression is that it is tilted a bit to the right, but it''s probably an illusion due to the bridge''s shape.  Well done.', '2006-06-25 17:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552128, 348886, 33392, '<td valign="top">I would love to hear how you did this.  Well done.</td>', 'I would love to hear how you did this.  Well done.', '2006-06-25 17:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552129, 349759, 33392, '<td valign="top">Clean and crisp.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Clean and crisp.  Nicely done.', '2006-06-25 17:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552130, 349083, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very impressive.  I would like to know the details (exposure, iso, etc) - I have built a scotch-mount to try some of this myself, but don''t know the particulars on how to use it.  Very well done.</td>', 'Very impressive.  I would like to know the details (exposure, iso, etc) - I have built a scotch-mount to try some of this myself, but don''t know the particulars on how to use it.  Very well done.', '2006-06-25 17:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552132, 350606, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think I would prefer the flag better centered, but nice lighting and colors.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think I would prefer the flag better centered, but nice lighting and colors.', '2006-06-25 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552134, 348762, 33392, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 - I like it a lot, but I think I might like it more as b/w.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 - I like it a lot, but I think I might like it more as b/w.', '2006-06-25 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552137, 350044, 33392, '<td valign="top">The low country - wonderful.  I like the ghosting of the reeds and grasses up front and the colors of the clouds.</td>', 'The low country - wonderful.  I like the ghosting of the reeds and grasses up front and the colors of the clouds.', '2006-06-25 17:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552139, 350023, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Don''t know how you did it, but very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.  Don''t know how you did it, but very well done.', '2006-06-25 17:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552142, 350846, 33392, '<td valign="top">Wow - impressive.  I''m assuming the colors are from a filter - I think I would prefer it in dark blue.</td>', 'Wow - impressive.  I''m assuming the colors are from a filter - I think I would prefer it in dark blue.', '2006-06-25 17:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552145, 349897, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  It isn''t as crisp as I would''ve liked, but still - very nice.</td>', 'Nice idea.  It isn''t as crisp as I would''ve liked, but still - very nice.', '2006-06-25 17:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552148, 349930, 33392, '<td valign="top">I love the subtle colors and the overall crispness.</td>', 'I love the subtle colors and the overall crispness.', '2006-06-25 17:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552151, 349947, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is well done.  It seems a bit brighter than I would have expected and/or preferred.</td>', 'This is well done.  It seems a bit brighter than I would have expected and/or preferred.', '2006-06-25 17:46:40.000000', NULL, 1);
