(2552167, 351032, 33392, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft effect of the water in the rapids.  Nice colors too.</td>', 'I really like the soft effect of the water in the rapids.  Nice colors too.', '2006-06-25 17:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
