(2556367, 349238, 13688, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped in to accentuate her face and that interesting curve of the hair.</td>', 'I would have cropped in to accentuate her face and that interesting curve of the hair.', '2006-06-26 22:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556385, 348969, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the softness of the clouds juxtaposed with the sharpness of the roof.  i wish the building wasn''t so centered, it just makes the image feel way to static for me.  Reflection colors are interesting, wish you used a bit tighter aperture or waited a few more minutes, to make the overall scene darker and enhance those reflections.  I think you would have still had plenty color in the sky to work with.</td>', 'i like the softness of the clouds juxtaposed with the sharpness of the roof.  i wish the building wasn''t so centered, it just makes the image feel way to static for me.  Reflection colors are interesting, wish you used a bit tighter aperture or waited a few more minutes, to make the overall scene darker and enhance those reflections.  I think you would have still had plenty color in the sky to work with.', '2006-06-26 23:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556394, 351000, 13688, '<td valign="top">I don''t know much about IR, but it is very intriguing to me that this is the result of a 30 sec exposure.  Perhaps you needed to add filters like a standard exposure, which is also perhaps why it seems a bit fuzzy.  Wish there had been a way to adjust the composition so the pipe wasn''t evident.</td>', 'I don''t know much about IR, but it is very intriguing to me that this is the result of a 30 sec exposure.  Perhaps you needed to add filters like a standard exposure, which is also perhaps why it seems a bit fuzzy.  Wish there had been a way to adjust the composition so the pipe wasn''t evident.', '2006-06-26 23:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556403, 350973, 13688, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp photo, for a night shot.  The coloring is interesting, but I wish there was a greater variety of toning to add a bit more interest.</td>', 'Nice crisp photo, for a night shot.  The coloring is interesting, but I wish there was a greater variety of toning to add a bit more interest.', '2006-06-26 23:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556409, 350991, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting combination of smoothing and sharpening.  First reaction was wow.    Closer inspection revealed perhaps a bit too much around the path area.  Still the leading lines, including the line of the open sky and stadium roof slant, is quite nice.</td>', 'interesting combination of smoothing and sharpening.  First reaction was wow.    Closer inspection revealed perhaps a bit too much around the path area.  Still the leading lines, including the line of the open sky and stadium roof slant, is quite nice.', '2006-06-26 23:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556419, 350510, 53039, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I like the framing. Like a neon sign.</td>', 'Very cool. I like the framing. Like a neon sign.', '2006-06-26 23:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556421, 350871, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting compostion...how you''ve placed the "good" conscience looking up and the "evil" one looking down.  Perhaps instead it is the "devilish" side acting well "devilish" and the "heavenly" side bitter that you seem to be leaning toward the dark side.  Perhaps I''m over analyzing.  Anyway, nice work.  For me, only problem is your main side needs to be in sharp focus like the other 2.  Seems like you didn''t even try to pp the contrast and sharpness, which adds to your photographic credibility, but will hurt your score here.</td>', 'interesting compostion...how you''ve placed the "good" conscience looking up and the "evil" one looking down.  Perhaps instead it is the "devilish" side acting well "devilish" and the "heavenly" side bitter that you seem to be leaning toward the dark side.  Perhaps I''m over analyzing.  Anyway, nice work.  For me, only problem is your main side needs to be in sharp focus like the other 2.  Seems like you didn''t even try to pp the contrast and sharpness, which adds to your photographic credibility, but will hurt your score here.', '2006-06-26 23:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556422, 349106, 53039, '<td valign="top">Very moody. Nice.</td>', 'Very moody. Nice.', '2006-06-26 23:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556423, 349901, 35078, '<td valign="top">Wow ... very cool! 10!</td>', 'Wow ... very cool! 10!', '2006-06-26 23:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556426, 350023, 53039, '<td valign="top">awesome.</td>', 'awesome.', '2006-06-26 23:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556428, 348762, 53039, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'absolutely beautiful.', '2006-06-26 23:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556433, 348543, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus.  lighting is ok.  perhaps i would have been more drawn in if the lighting was less yellow and more white.  Also, the abundance of necklaces feels cluttered for me.  I wish you had stuck with one...perhaps just the heart and wrapped it in such a way that really built an interesting composition.</td>', 'nice focus.  lighting is ok.  perhaps i would have been more drawn in if the lighting was less yellow and more white.  Also, the abundance of necklaces feels cluttered for me.  I wish you had stuck with one...perhaps just the heart and wrapped it in such a way that really built an interesting composition.', '2006-06-26 23:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556477, 350986, 13688, '<td valign="top">Jackson Pollock on Red Bull.  I''m not sure what the center object is but that definitely does add a bit of intrigue to the image.</td>', 'Jackson Pollock on Red Bull.  I''m not sure what the center object is but that definitely does add a bit of intrigue to the image.', '2006-06-26 23:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556487, 350136, 13688, '<td valign="top">great focus and lighting.  i wish the building signage wasn''t there, as it over powers the rest of the image for me.</td>', 'great focus and lighting.  i wish the building signage wasn''t there, as it over powers the rest of the image for me.', '2006-06-26 23:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556490, 348582, 13688, '<td valign="top">this image gives me a creepy feeling that someone is going to jump me from behind.  I''m glad i''m not standing there...cool.</td>', 'this image gives me a creepy feeling that someone is going to jump me from behind.  I''m glad i''m not standing there...cool.', '2006-06-26 23:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556538, 351030, 13688, '<td valign="top">I''d hate to be the assistant who had to help position the model.  I wouldn''t do it for a whole case of PBR...well...maybe for two.</td>', 'I''d hate to be the assistant who had to help position the model.  I wouldn''t do it for a whole case of PBR...well...maybe for two.', '2006-06-27 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556558, 350194, 13688, '<td valign="top">this is my first clock, which makes it cool.  I wish your strobes were timed so the second hand fell on the digits.  I actually kind of wish there wasn''t a 2nd hand at all and just the blurring of the minute hand...that would give it a super, eerie kind of feel for me.</td>', 'this is my first clock, which makes it cool.  I wish your strobes were timed so the second hand fell on the digits.  I actually kind of wish there wasn''t a 2nd hand at all and just the blurring of the minute hand...that would give it a super, eerie kind of feel for me.', '2006-06-27 00:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556581, 348910, 13688, '<td valign="top">The problem is your shooting 4''s and 5''s and she wants a man who can give her 6''s and 7''s.  If your not careful she may be vacationing in Iceland soon.  Please, for the sake of your relationship learn just a wee bit of photoshop.</td>', 'The problem is your shooting 4''s and 5''s and she wants a man who can give her 6''s and 7''s.  If your not careful she may be vacationing in Iceland soon.  Please, for the sake of your relationship learn just a wee bit of photoshop.', '2006-06-27 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556583, 351046, 50355, '<td valign="top">Good color, however the planes in the background are kind of strange looking as well as the helos around the trees.</td>', 'Good color, however the planes in the background are kind of strange looking as well as the helos around the trees.', '2006-06-27 00:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556585, 348832, 50355, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the stars, but I think the contrast and saturation could have been up''ed a bit.  Also there is some grain in the mountians.</td>', 'Nice capture of the stars, but I think the contrast and saturation could have been up''ed a bit.  Also there is some grain in the mountians.', '2006-06-27 00:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556587, 348911, 50355, '<td valign="top">What a creative idea!!!  Is that the speedometer on the drivers'' hand?</td>', 'What a creative idea!!!  Is that the speedometer on the drivers'' hand?', '2006-06-27 00:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556591, 350147, 50355, '<td valign="top">This picture seems a bit candid.  I see what you''re trying to get at, but I think, considering the title of the picture and the challenge, you could have set the picture up a little differently.</td>', 'This picture seems a bit candid.  I see what you''re trying to get at, but I think, considering the title of the picture and the challenge, you could have set the picture up a little differently.', '2006-06-27 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556592, 349961, 50355, '<td valign="top">This is a very clear picture for the night!  Good job!</td>', 'This is a very clear picture for the night!  Good job!', '2006-06-27 00:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556595, 349954, 50355, '<td valign="top">This picture is very, very clear, but I think the main subject is a little too far away.</td>', 'This picture is very, very clear, but I think the main subject is a little too far away.', '2006-06-27 00:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556596, 350606, 13688, '<td valign="top">great exposure to not blow the interior lighting.  Though upon close inspection the overall contrast feels odd.  Also odd you didn''t place the flag at the center as it''s neither center nor really off-center.  This is the first capitol shot I''ve ever seen that didn''t show the dome.  I''ll give you an extra point for being different, though I would have given you 2 extra points if you showed the dome.  I believe that''s what they call dpc logic.</td>', 'great exposure to not blow the interior lighting.  Though upon close inspection the overall contrast feels odd.  Also odd you didn''t place the flag at the center as it''s neither center nor really off-center.  This is the first capitol shot I''ve ever seen that didn''t show the dome.  I''ll give you an extra point for being different, though I would have given you 2 extra points if you showed the dome.  I believe that''s what they call dpc logic.', '2006-06-27 00:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556599, 350162, 50355, '<td valign="top">What an idea!!  The shot is great, but it seems a bit dull.  Maybe up the contrast a bit to darken the image.</td>', 'What an idea!!  The shot is great, but it seems a bit dull.  Maybe up the contrast a bit to darken the image.', '2006-06-27 00:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556601, 350999, 50355, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast from white to dark in this image.  Very clear too.</td>', 'I love the contrast from white to dark in this image.  Very clear too.', '2006-06-27 00:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
