(2556618, 349744, 50355, '<td valign="top">Good image, but I think the lights on the boats turned out to be a bit much.  Also, I can see where the decompression of the image makes the sky looked toned.  But still a good picture.</td>', 'Good image, but I think the lights on the boats turned out to be a bit much.  Also, I can see where the decompression of the image makes the sky looked toned.  But still a good picture.', '2006-06-27 00:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
