(2561247, 350846, 40819, '<td valign="top">Hi Rikki, congrats on your ribbon. Someday maybe even I will get one. <br/> <br/>What I loved about this was the red sky, violet water and the green grass. I thought that looked wonderful. I think you could have done it with a few less filters. I shot at dawn once and it was really really a red sky and I called it "Sailor be Warned" you can see it here:<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=245629" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/245629.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/245629.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/245629.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I love when we can capture with our cameras what most people miss in day to day life. You did real good here.</td>', 'Hi Rikki, congrats on your ribbon. Someday maybe even I will get one.  What I loved about this was the red sky, violet water and the green grass. I thought that looked wonderful. I think you could have done it with a few less filters. I shot at dawn once and it was really really a red sky and I called it "Sailor be Warned" you can see it here:  I love when we can capture with our cameras what most people miss in day to day life. You did real good here.', '2006-06-28 09:35:24.000000', NULL, 0),
