(2561310, 349399, 48228, '<td valign="top">I know I commented on this during the challenge, as I gave you a "10".  I just have to let you know that I have added this image as a favorite as well. It is just so beautifu;, so serene, so peaceful and yes, so like velvet.....</td>', 'I know I commented on this during the challenge, as I gave you a "10".  I just have to let you know that I have added this image as a favorite as well. It is just so beautifu;, so serene, so peaceful and yes, so like velvet.....', '2006-06-28 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561314, 348792, 45524, '<td valign="top">My opinion of this shot is that its very flat and dull. Needs contrast and has lost alot of detail in the shadows. Composition is pretty good although it doesnt follow all the rules of composition it works pretty well here. The photo seems almost underexposed for a 30 second entry. I would think that with the sun just coming up as stated that at 30 seconds this might have been alot sharper and with more detail. I''m confused though you say you shot it wide open on the 18-55 which would be 2.8 and on your details you show f11. I can assume by wide open then that you mean 18mm. Anyway thats my take on it and I think it scored about where my vote would have been had I voted.</td>', 'My opinion of this shot is that its very flat and dull. Needs contrast and has lost alot of detail in the shadows. Composition is pretty good although it doesnt follow all the rules of composition it works pretty well here. The photo seems almost underexposed for a 30 second entry. I would think that with the sun just coming up as stated that at 30 seconds this might have been alot sharper and with more detail. I''m confused though you say you shot it wide open on the 18-55 which would be 2.8 and on your details you show f11. I can assume by wide open then that you mean 18mm. Anyway thats my take on it and I think it scored about where my vote would have been had I voted.', '2006-06-28 09:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561326, 349689, 27763, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  My favorite of the three ribbon winners. Unfortunately, you are not allowed to clone out sensor dust, though!  Too bad.  Still a great shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  My favorite of the three ribbon winners. Unfortunately, you are not allowed to clone out sensor dust, though!  Too bad.  Still a great shot.', '2006-06-28 10:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561391, 350510, 30049, '<td valign="top">From your Photographer''s Comments: "I did some clone work to remove unwanted reflections added a border and I was ready to go!"<br/> <br/>It''s a good thing nobody challenged this image to a validation during voting.  Cloning is a no-no for basic editing as it''s considered Spot-Editing.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_rules.php?RULES_ID=10" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Challenge Rules (Basic)</a> <br/> <br/>Congrat''s on this making your personal best!<br/> <br/>Take care!</td>', 'From your Photographer''s Comments: "I did some clone work to remove unwanted reflections added a border and I was ready to go!" It''s a good thing nobody challenged this image to a validation during voting.  Cloning is a no-no for basic editing as it''s considered Spot-Editing. Challenge Rules (Basic)  Congrat''s on this making your personal best! Take care!', '2006-06-28 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561412, 351035, 60275, '<td valign="top">Thanks for everybody taking the time to vote. Im happy for my first score above 6 and for the positive comments received. Also, Im glad to see that the 6 gradually visible seconds in a 30 SECONDS exposure got noticed  not so easy to get it without PS.</td>', 'Thanks for everybody taking the time to vote. Im happy for my first score above 6 and for the positive comments received. Also, Im glad to see that the 6 gradually visible seconds in a 30 SECONDS exposure got noticed  not so easy to get it without PS.', '2006-06-28 10:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561433, 349930, 30049, '<td valign="top">Thought for sure you were heading for a top five with this.  FWIW I gave it a 10.  ;^)<br/> <br/>Beautiful image!</td>', 'Thought for sure you were heading for a top five with this.  FWIW I gave it a 10.  ;^) Beautiful image!', '2006-06-28 10:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561440, 351035, 60275, '<td valign="top">Forgot to mention, if anybody interested how it was done. Rewired the clocks battery connection and manually advanced the second hand during the 30s exposure. Unfortunately, my camera can do maximum 30s and I had to play with different settings and lights to get the ticks visible enough.</td>', 'Forgot to mention, if anybody interested how it was done. Rewired the clocks battery connection and manually advanced the second hand during the 30s exposure. Unfortunately, my camera can do maximum 30s and I had to play with different settings and lights to get the ticks visible enough.', '2006-06-28 10:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561441, 350036, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey.  Top 20!  Congratulations!!!  Honestly I had you pegged for a ribbon with this.<br/> <br/>Nonetheless - great job!<br/> <br/>Smile and keep having fun.  ;^)</td>', 'Hey.  Top 20!  Congratulations!!!  Honestly I had you pegged for a ribbon with this. Nonetheless - great job! Smile and keep having fun.  ;^)', '2006-06-28 10:35:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561574, 349801, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I thought it deserved a higher placement. Nice vivid tones and clear shot.</td>', 'Nice shot. I thought it deserved a higher placement. Nice vivid tones and clear shot.', '2006-06-28 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561576, 350408, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I didn''t vote in this challenge but did glance through and knew this was yours. Excellent job. I love the starburst lights. The water is very calm and the deep blues are peaceful. The boat caught my eye in the thumbnail (which is how I knew it was yours). It has a really nice reflective quality to it.</td>', 'Trading post...  I didn''t vote in this challenge but did glance through and knew this was yours. Excellent job. I love the starburst lights. The water is very calm and the deep blues are peaceful. The boat caught my eye in the thumbnail (which is how I knew it was yours). It has a really nice reflective quality to it.', '2006-06-28 11:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561695, 350053, 57658, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad this finished so well. I was over in Jamestown during the evening trying to get a 30 second shot but there was still too much light and I couldn''t wait -  but if I did it <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=352452" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/57658/thumb/352452.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/57658/thumb/352452.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/57658/thumb/352452.jpg"/> </a> still wouldn''t have turned out anything like yours !!<br/> <br/>Congratulations!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-28 10:36:53.</i></td>', 'I''m so glad this finished so well. I was over in Jamestown during the evening trying to get a 30 second shot but there was still too much light and I couldn''t wait -  but if I did it   still wouldn''t have turned out anything like yours !! Congratulations!!!', '2006-06-28 11:34:22.000000', '2006-06-28 11:36:53.000000', 0),
