(2563166, 351000, 4517, '<td valign="top">You picked a tricky challenge to do your 1st ir photo entry. At 40 seconds the trees are always going to look soft in even the slightest breeze. The hot-spot in the middle is hardly noticeable and you have mastered the channel swapping already. A very respectable score and i`m sure your going to score even higher when you get your shutter speed faster.<br/>A great start to IR :)</td>', 'You picked a tricky challenge to do your 1st ir photo entry. At 40 seconds the trees are always going to look soft in even the slightest breeze. The hot-spot in the middle is hardly noticeable and you have mastered the channel swapping already. A very respectable score and i`m sure your going to score even higher when you get your shutter speed faster.A great start to IR :)', '2006-06-28 17:52:10.000000', NULL, 0),
