(2563227, 349399, 37719, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...well composed and the colors are fantastic.  I love how the range is all in the blues.  Textures on the rocks in the foregound give it a placement of strength while the rest of the shot gives it a nice soft feel...excellent contrast.  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful shot...well composed and the colors are fantastic.  I love how the range is all in the blues.  Textures on the rocks in the foregound give it a placement of strength while the rest of the shot gives it a nice soft feel...excellent contrast.  Well done!', '2006-06-28 18:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
