(2563234, 350044, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nice color range and well preserved.  The composition is good - love the swaying grasses in the foreground...balancecs out the sharper lines in the distance.  Well done with the lines of the clouds seem to be in synch with the lines of the water.  Well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-30 18:07:55.</i></td>', 'Nice color range and well preserved.  The composition is good - love the swaying grasses in the foreground...balancecs out the sharper lines in the distance.  Well done with the lines of the clouds seem to be in synch with the lines of the water.  Well done!', '2006-06-28 18:14:17.000000', '2006-06-30 19:07:55.000000', 0),
(2563250, 349232, 37719, '<td valign="top">Such patience to sit for this.  The lighting is perfect and the scene is very well composed.  Just the right balance between water and land with your placement.  The colors are well preserved and not distorted with the exposure.  Reading your description and, I hate to admit it, being familiar with the ST reference you made, this is right in step.  Very well done Jimmy!  Nice job!</td>', 'Such patience to sit for this.  The lighting is perfect and the scene is very well composed.  Just the right balance between water and land with your placement.  The colors are well preserved and not distorted with the exposure.  Reading your description and, I hate to admit it, being familiar with the ST reference you made, this is right in step.  Very well done Jimmy!  Nice job!', '2006-06-28 18:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563409, 350620, 57886, '<td valign="top">So it is rain :o) This image is so nice. Congratulations on the high score, well done..</td>', 'So it is rain :o) This image is so nice. Congratulations on the high score, well done..', '2006-06-28 18:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
