(2563621, 350546, 57456, '<td valign="top">As I am pretty new to DPC, I am enjoying my stay. I have already learned a huge amount of knowledge from everyone and hope to put it to use. I realize I still have a lot to learn and that will come in time. Most of all, I really appreciate all the comments about my photos...Yes, even the negative ones. I am not easily offended when someone dislikes my work and take all comments seriously. <br/> <br/>Bottom Line: Thanks to EVERYONE who comments, you are only helping me!<br/> <br/></td>', 'As I am pretty new to DPC, I am enjoying my stay. I have already learned a huge amount of knowledge from everyone and hope to put it to use. I realize I still have a lot to learn and that will come in time. Most of all, I really appreciate all the comments about my photos...Yes, even the negative ones. I am not easily offended when someone dislikes my work and take all comments seriously.  Bottom Line: Thanks to EVERYONE who comments, you are only helping me! ', '2006-06-28 19:36:32.000000', NULL, 0),
