(2567927, 350408, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>I''ve not yet even had the chance to look through the entries for this challenge - I''m surprised, though, that this is below a 6.  It looks almost "Rikki''d" by the way.  The blue is awesome, particularly the water - very rich.  I recognize your boat over there on the right.  The only minor distraction for me is the building (?) in front of your boat - the greenish color sort of stands out.  I do, however, realize there isn''t anything you can do about that in basic.  As for balance, I''d maybe pull the horizon just a wee bit lower... Nope.  Just tried it and I like it better your way.</td>', 'Trading Post comment I''ve not yet even had the chance to look through the entries for this challenge - I''m surprised, though, that this is below a 6.  It looks almost "Rikki''d" by the way.  The blue is awesome, particularly the water - very rich.  I recognize your boat over there on the right.  The only minor distraction for me is the building (?) in front of your boat - the greenish color sort of stands out.  I do, however, realize there isn''t anything you can do about that in basic.  As for balance, I''d maybe pull the horizon just a wee bit lower... Nope.  Just tried it and I like it better your way.', '2006-06-29 23:28:46.000000', NULL, 0),
