(2570129, 349238, 56797, '<td valign="top">I agree that the light is a little too bright in spots and theres way too much arm in the shot. I gave it a five which is better than you averaged but generally my low. like a 5 for trying. looking at it here id think more of a 6 or 7 by my standards but for me to have given it a 5 it must have just been lost in comprision to some other really good shot. thats my best guess.</td>', 'I agree that the light is a little too bright in spots and theres way too much arm in the shot. I gave it a five which is better than you averaged but generally my low. like a 5 for trying. looking at it here id think more of a 6 or 7 by my standards but for me to have given it a 5 it must have just been lost in comprision to some other really good shot. thats my best guess.', '2006-06-30 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
