(2578256, 348886, 34938, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10...it should have done so much better and I cannot understand the voting trends...you have a great daughter and you pulled off an excellent shot that bamboozled most of us. I thought that you would have done it the way you described when I saw it, but it''s so well done, you have to look twice, no, three times! :-) I wish this finished higher</td>', 'I gave this a 10...it should have done so much better and I cannot understand the voting trends...you have a great daughter and you pulled off an excellent shot that bamboozled most of us. I thought that you would have done it the way you described when I saw it, but it''s so well done, you have to look twice, no, three times! :-) I wish this finished higher', '2006-07-03 10:00:47.000000', NULL, 0),
