(2769694, 350938, 58537, '<td valign="top">For long image exposures set the long exposure noise reduction.  It takes a second exposure of the back of the shutter and subtracts the artifacts from the original exposure.  as for noise, bah  look at a iso 1600 piece of film :-P</td>', 'For long image exposures set the long exposure noise reduction.  It takes a second exposure of the back of the shutter and subtracts the artifacts from the original exposure.  as for noise, bah  look at a iso 1600 piece of film :-P', '2006-08-29 04:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
