(2933074, 348876, 14986, '<td valign="top">I have yet to get a REALLY good shot of our bridge.  If I get one as good as this, I''ll definitely be satisfied.  I love the clarity and the colors.  The star effects add interest as well.  The composition feels just a bit cramped at the top of the bridge to me, but nothing major. <br/> <br/>Excellent shot - I''m glad it finished well.</td>', 'I have yet to get a REALLY good shot of our bridge.  If I get one as good as this, I''ll definitely be satisfied.  I love the clarity and the colors.  The star effects add interest as well.  The composition feels just a bit cramped at the top of the bridge to me, but nothing major.  Excellent shot - I''m glad it finished well.', '2006-10-16 11:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
