(3324644, 349526, 66384, '<td valign="top">This was a very difficult challenge for your first entry on DPC. I hope you weren''t discouraged by your score. I''d love to see more of your work. You''ll see that some will score well and some won''t, and it''s not always a true indicator of your pictures quality. Sometimes the voters just don''t get it, or they are in a hurry, or a lousy mood, or they don''t connect with the subject. Keep trying, and you will learn a lot here.</td>', 'This was a very difficult challenge for your first entry on DPC. I hope you weren''t discouraged by your score. I''d love to see more of your work. You''ll see that some will score well and some won''t, and it''s not always a true indicator of your pictures quality. Sometimes the voters just don''t get it, or they are in a hurry, or a lousy mood, or they don''t connect with the subject. Keep trying, and you will learn a lot here.', '2007-02-03 23:28:54.000000', NULL, 0),
