(3571007, 350693, 72423, '<td valign="top">I like this. Long exposures with flashlight assistance are full of potential, as you have demonstrated.  Did you see any hot white pixels.  I guess not seeing as this was a basic editing challenge.<br/> <br/>When I tried some shots like this I saw some white pixels at 15 and 30 sec exposures. Easy to edit out, but this is not allowed for basic editing.</td>', 'I like this. Long exposures with flashlight assistance are full of potential, as you have demonstrated.  Did you see any hot white pixels.  I guess not seeing as this was a basic editing challenge. When I tried some shots like this I saw some white pixels at 15 and 30 sec exposures. Easy to edit out, but this is not allowed for basic editing.', '2007-04-22 18:08:12.000000', NULL, 0),
